WEBVTT

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.940
Destiny

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.570
Showing poor taste as ever, I see.

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.510
Suigintou, come on out!

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:33.060
I've become junk.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.230
Give me that face.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:38.970
Give it to me!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.790
What a beautiful face...

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:46.240
Please, give it to me!

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:51.550
<i>So your power the other day
really was from your medium.</i>

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.030
<i>I knew there was no way
you could be so powerful.</i>

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.110
Suigintou!

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.400
<i>I promised you, didn't I?</i>

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.720
<i>That we would settle this one-on-one.</i>

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.040
<i>In order to do that,</i>

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:03.720
<i>I must ensure
your medium can't interfere.</i>

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:05.540
You don't mean...

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:23.940
What the heck?

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.580
You're...

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.420
Long time no see, Jun-kun.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:36.590
What do you want?

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:39.300
Don't scowl at me like that.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:41.590
It ruins your adorable face.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:43.870
My body...

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.220
Night is time for sleep.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.690
Sweet dreams.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:04.110
Now everything is ready.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.250
Jun!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.700
Jun! Jun!

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.440
You really are such a dummy.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.170
Suigintou, what have you done to Jun?

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.370
I just had him fall into 
a dream for a while.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.510
But, Shinku,

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:39.510
when humans can no longer
differentiate between dreams and reality...

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.740
I hear they become broken.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.740
Don't be so impatient.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:52.700
You needn't worry.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:56.770
Suigintou will torment 
you long and well.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:59.270
You should not say such idiotic things.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.740
Even without such a servant's powers,
I can defeat you.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.770
After all, you are a piece of junk.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.080
How dare you!

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.590
I'll make you dance.

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:36.170
I wonder how long you'll last?

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:48.660
Everything you can do I can do.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:49.480
Had you forgotten that?

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:50.980
Shinku!

00:05:57.950 --> 00:05:58.950
Jun!

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:00.630
Don't let yourself be fooled!

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:02.620
Jun!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.880
This is...

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:21.490
<i>Everyone, Sakurada finally
came in third in the nation!</i>

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:26.540
<i>No one from this accelerated class
has failed in the last two years.</i>

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.450
<i>All of you, put your energy into
working hard like Sakurada!</i>

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:31.820
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.060
What in the world is this?

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:38.440
<i>Sakurada, you just worry 
about your health.</i>

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.650
<i>The exam is just a week away...</i>

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:40.630
<i>No!</i>

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:41.830
<i>What?</i>

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.800
<i>No!</i>

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.170
<i>This is...</i>

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.640
<i>No!</i>

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:50.400
No... No...

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.560
No!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.150
This can't be... Why...

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:02.240
<i>Did you hear about the Sakurada boy?</i>

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:04.160
<i>Whoever thought he'd fail?</i>

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.290
<i>Jun-kun, you didn't make it in?</i>

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:06.290
Stop it!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.820
<i>No way! I don't believe it!</i>

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:07.740
Stop it...

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:09.350
I don't want to hear this.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.650
<i>That's pitiful.</i>

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.650
Stop it...

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.840
Stop it... Stop it...

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.850
Stop it!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.670
Jun, please...

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:32.780
Don't be fooled by the dream...

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.560
It's no use.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:39.040
I shut the doorway to dreams tightly
so he could never get out.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.020
That boy is going to become
broken in his dreams.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:46.360
If you don't want that to happen,
hand over your Rosa Mystica.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:47.530
No.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.070
Father said...

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:55.270
We Rozen Maidens are not meant
to torment or harm humans.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.340
I can't yield my Rosa Mystica
to junk who can't abide by his words!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.580
I am not junk!

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:11.490
If you have a message,
 would you like me to convey it to him?

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:16.390
Since I'll be sending these two
into his dream now.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:19.660
Suigintou, stop this.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.150
I'm not stopping.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:33.720
Shinku, you're wasting your time.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.840
You won't get away.

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.190
<i>Sakurada tested to get into
a private school, right?</i>

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:41.120
<i>What's he doing here?</i>

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.290
<i>Say, Sakurada,</i>

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:43.150
<i>That's just it!</i>

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.260
<i>I heard this from your big sis yesterday...</i>

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:44.580
<i>I heard he didn't get in!</i>

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:46.000
<i>...but you're good at needlework?</i>

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.600
<i>For real?</i>

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.300
<i>He was so smart too!</i>

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.300
<i>Talk about unexpected.</i>

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:50.380
<i>You've got this image 
like all you do is study.</i>

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.890
<i>Oh, my button's about to come off, but...</i>

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:52.890
Shut up!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.360
Shut up!

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.400
I don't want this!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.640
I don't want to be here!

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.410
I wasn't supposed to end up here!

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:00.900
Don't talk to me so familiarly!

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:03.250
I'm not like you guys!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.340
Don't think we're the same!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:05.590
<i>Sheesh.</i>

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:08.280
<i>I thought I'd talk to you
because you were all alone.</i>

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:10.340
<i>Later, Needlework Boy.</i>

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:12.740
Shut up...

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:13.960
Shut up.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.260
Please, I've had enough of this.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.840
I don't want to be here.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:27.240
I don't want this!
 I don't want this!

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.330
I don't want this!

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:34.170
Um, yes, that's right.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:35.670
Sis...

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:38.970
Sis!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.390
I don't want to baby-sit Jun anymore.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:45.940
I can't do my club activities
or go have fun with my friends.

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.980
I really wish I didn't have 
a kid brother like him.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:53.110
Please, Mom, you guys take him.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:56.720
Okay? It's not fair to 
just foist him off on me.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.080
Sis...

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.380
<i>It was my mistake to have
high expectations of you.</i>

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:05.320
<i>You actually can't do anything, can you?</i>

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:06.810
<i>You good-for-nothing!</i>

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.560
In the end, you're just being a baby.

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:12.010
I'm tired of baby-sitting you.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:13.140
I'm sick of it.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.510
I hate you!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.240
I was so relieved to get away from you.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.390
He's a wretch after all.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:20.800
I've never seen someone 
as useless as you.

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.700
Aren't you ashamed to even be alive?

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:42.640
Shinku, you seem to be hurting there.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.820
Could it be your medium's 
power is lacking?

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:54.380
There you are.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:57.760
I don't want to be "it" 
the whole time, Shinku.

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:00.510
Let us play a different game now.

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:22.150
Jun-kun...

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.710
The damn girl woke up.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.380
Suiseiseki...

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.830
It is an emergency!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.890
Hurry up and go to sleep, you!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.050
Wait!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.100
I'm sorry to be so abrupt.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.720
We want you to let us into your dream.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:39.910
Into my dream?

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.720
Something's happened 
to Jun-kun, hasn't it?

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:46.140
I sensed the chibi human's 
doorway to dreams opening,

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.610
so we came to see.

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:48.770
When we got here...

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:52.760
He is currently locked away
inside a sealed dream.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.870
In order to save him,
 someone must go.

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:58.240
If we had Lempicka and Sui Dream,

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:01.210
we could force open the 
doorway to dreams...

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:03.880
but because of that damned Suigintou...

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:07.100
You are the person who 
is closest to Jun-kun.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:10.120
There should be a connection
to Jun-kun's dream somewhere.

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:13.520
So if you would cooperate with us...

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.190
I understand.
 What do I need to do?

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.330
This!

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.470
We're counting on you, Hina-Ichigo.

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:29.630
Leave it to me.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.470
Say, Shinku...

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:38.980
there's something I've always
wanted to try once.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.410
Do you know what that is?

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:44.320
That is to play with a doll.

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:50.580
To move my doll about
in whatever way I pleased...

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:55.630
make it say whatever I wished,
and throw it away when it breaks!

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.800
You can't break on me yet.

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:10.140
It's still scary!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.090
Shinku! Shinku!

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:15.940
Shinku!

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:20.440
Thirty points!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:23.390
Hurry up and give me
my prize of the Rosa Mystica.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.390
No.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.100
Just as I thought.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.140
Even if you were torn to pieces,

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:32.260
you'd never say that you'd 
hand it over, would you?

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.470
And that's why...

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:45.810
Jun!

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:48.330
At this rate, he will become broken.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:49.880
Are you sure you don't need to save him?

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.050
Suigintou, you...

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:55.010
All you have to do is give 
me your Rosa Mystica.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.000
Save that boy by sacrificing yourself.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.580
It sounds like a farce 
that would appeal to you.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.890
Hurry up. I hate laggards.

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:06.200
I refuse.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:10.070
My Rosa Mystica is not so impure
that I would give it to a piece of junk.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.070
Fine.

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:13.500
In that case...

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.910
Don't be mean to Shinku!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.940
Hina-Ichigo!

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:26.450
Shinku!

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:45.220
Everyone's gone...

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.240
Hina's coming too!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:51.840
Why is it so thin?

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:55.240
The bond between you 
two is growing weaker.

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.100
And the branches are 
beginning to wither.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.980
Just as we thought,
something's happened to him.

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:02.640
Oh, no!

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.140
Hey!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.910
What a forlorn place.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.930
This is the inside of the runt's dream.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.440
Oh no!

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.240
The tiny tree is withering away!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:32.940
This is not good.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:37.820
What about Jun-kun?

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:39.550
Where's Jun-kun?

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.730
This is...

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:44.730
Nori, get down!

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:49.720
Shinku?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:52.370
Jun is beyond this fog.

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.640
Do I sense a party getting started?

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.870
Suiseiseki, you protect Jun's tree.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.380
All right!

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:06.140
Nori, you should be the one
who understands Jun best.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:07.950
Take care of Jun for me.

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:09.820
Shinku-chan...

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.850
Souseiseki!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.410
It's not fair.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.400
Two against one isn't fair!

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.400
You won't get away with it.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:31.340
I'll never let you get away with it!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.110
Jun-kun?

00:16:57.980 --> 00:16:58.920
Stay away!

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:05.260
No matter how I tried, I couldn't
somersault on the horizontal bar.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.160
In my first year in middle school...

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:10.620
I said terrible things to the guys
who talked to me and mocked them.

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:14.980
I took your cooking and 
threw it out the window.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.110
I made trouble by ordering things
I didn't even want.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:22.550
I'm a really terrible person.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.480
Jun-kun! Jun-kun!

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.750
I'm sorry, Sis.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:31.430
I just trouble you by saying nasty things
when I can't do anything.

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:32.560
That's not true.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.760
It'd be better if a guy 
like me didn't exist.

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:37.750
What are you saying?

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:42.400
Don't worry.
 I'll be gone soon.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:43.940
Then...

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:47.810
Then you'll be able to spend lots of time
on club activities.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.550
You'll be able to have 
fun with your friends.

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:52.200
I...

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:54.510
I'm no good,
 no matter what I do.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.790
All I ever do is make 
trouble for you, Sis.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:58.650
Jun-kun...

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:02.980
You hate having a kid brother
like me too, don't you?

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.130
That's not true!

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:06.860
I don't think that!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.550
Don't lie to me!

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:09.360
Jun-kun!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.390
I'm in your way!

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:13.080
Tell the truth!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.530
Jun-kun!

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:15.870
I can't do anything but sulk!

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:15.870
Jun-kun!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:20.620
I... I'm no good.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.480
I'm sorry about everything.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.500
I'm sorry, Sis.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.870
What are you saying?

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:32.490
But...

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.960
That's right!
 You're no good!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:41.610
But there isn't a person 
in the world who isn't.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.250
Everyone thinks that they're no good.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.510
That they're hopeless.

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:47.700
They think that and think that
and think that all the time.

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:49.930
I think that too.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.880
That I'm a no-good big sister
who can't help you recover.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:56.840
I'm sure it's the same with Mom and Dad.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.420
Tomoe-chan too.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.810
Everyone's like that.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.310
That's why everyone tries hard.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:08.480
They try to laugh so they don't
lose to themselves.

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.090
They try to be cheerful!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.560
I won't let you run away 
without doing anything!

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.600
I'll never let you get away with that!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.310
Souseiseki!

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:43.940
Shinku...

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.520
To live...

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:04.000
Holie!

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:05.990
Meimei.

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:17.150
<i>Because to live is to fight, isn't it?</i>

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.660
Shinku...

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:27.200
Shinku!

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:34.730
Oh, Shinku,
 you really are such a dummy.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:38.070
Did you seriously think
you could win against me?

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.850
Listen carefully, Shinku.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.220
I'll spell it out for you.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.620
A broken doll...

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:54.260
I am not!

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.460
A piece of junk...

00:20:58.890 --> 00:20:59.560
I am not!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:17.450
Shinku!

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.440
You look pathetic, Shinku.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.800
How fitting for a loser.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.300
Shinku!

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:46.670
Jun!

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:50.440
The medium...

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.140
I will...

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:55.650
I will protect Shinku!

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:43.260
I am Shinku.

00:23:43.570 --> 00:23:46.720
Over much time and across
numerous encounters...

00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:48.090
I am now here.

00:23:48.700 --> 00:23:51.130
I do not know if I am 
worthy of becoming Alice.

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:52.930
But I will fight.

00:23:53.310 --> 00:23:56.260
For to fight is to live.

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.190
Watch me, Father.

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:00.040
See how I live my life.

00:24:00.820 --> 00:24:02.630
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 12
Shinku

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:06.400
I am Shinku, the fifth 
Rozen Maiden doll...

00:24:06.570 --> 00:24:08.040
And also...
